-future-supplements?p=768677#post768677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Currently, there are eight Beast projects in various stages of development:<br /> <br /> Beast Ready Made Characters<br /> Beast Fiction Anthology<br /> Beast Player's Guide<br /> Beast Storyteller's Guide<br /> Night Horrors: Conquering Heroes<br /> Mortal Remains: Beast mini-supplement<br /> Building a Legend (chronicle quickstart guide)<br /> A Beast section for the Dark Eras Companion (Reconstruction period American South)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In order:<br /> <br /> Got the final draft from Hayley yesterday, so it's in development<br /> Final drafts are due next week<br /> Haven't outlined it yet; waiting on some info from Rich<br /> I think you dreamed this one<br /> First drafts are in progress; Danielle Lauzon is developing it<br /> I know David Hill was getting it going, but he's been under the weather lately so it might have slipped<br /> Outlining and contracting stage<br /> In development with the rest of the Dark Eras Companion<br /> <br /> There ya go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T10:37:21-08:00","id":769389,"title":"","content":"The Storyteller's Guide was mentioned in the 2015-2016 Onyx Path brochure, so should we assume that's outdated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","av