eonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 11-19-2015, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T06:00:16-08:00","id":769902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/768654-future-supplements#post768654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. . . Would like to see a book of Heroes or such...</div> </div> </div> </div>Given some of the changes made to the Kickstarter draft, I'd be shocked if we don't see supplements supporting Heroes as player-characters somewhere along the way.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i><u>Edit</u></i>: I also wouldn't be surprised to see a <i>Lairs and Hives</i> supplement, detailing some of the bigger/more infamous/interesting Beast homesteads out there. Those used to be very common in the oWoD, and given the sky is (literally) the limit in the Primordial Dream, the writers could get as creative/nightmarish/bizarre as they wanted.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","user":"One Vorlon","date":". 11-20-2015, 09:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T20:51:39-08:00","id":784520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/768654-future-supplements?p=769400#post769400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is it a bad sign if I start dreaming of Beast, Matt...? That seems ominous...<br /> <br /> (Oops, I was just going by the brochure. They were directed dreams!)</div> </div> </div> </div>True story, when I was working on the first draft for the Dark Era, I took a break to watch the <i>Black Mirror </i>episode &quot;The Waldo Moment&quot;. And then I took a shower and wrapped my hair in a blue towel and started working more on the draft, and then I saw a FLASH OF BLUE IN THE CORNER OF MY EYE and I FLIPPED OUT and had to stop writing for the night, and then that night I had a nightmare that was a <b>Beast</b> crossover with &quot;The Waldo Moment&quot;.<br /> <br /> TRUE. STORY.<br /> <br /> And THEN. AND THEN. I posted about it on Facebook and Matt liked it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/c